<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Northern Telecom EPS view.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Northern Telecom EPS view.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial said Wednesday it raised its earnings estimates on Northern Telecom Ltd for fiscal 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 estimate to $3.17 per share from $3.07.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1998 estimate to $3.85 per share from $3.80.</p>
<p>-- Kept short-term hold and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- NYSE-listed shares rose 2-3/16 to 100-3/16.</p>
</text>
